%% Tenant staff invitation, access changes, reset, and deactivation
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Owner as Tenant owner/admin
    participant Invitee as Invited staff member
    participant Web as Admin dashboard
    participant API as Staff access API
    participant Guard as Role/permission/membership guards
    participant Staff as StaffAccessService
    participant DB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant Mail as Invitation/reset delivery
    participant Audit as Tenant audit

    Owner->>Web: Open staff access management
    Web->>API: GET /admin/staff
    API->>Guard: Validate staff-read permission and membership
    Guard->>Staff: Load staff and invitation overview
    Staff->>DB: Read tenant-local staff/access state
    DB-->>Staff: Staff, roles, permissions, expiry state
    Staff-->>API: Staff, roles, permissions, expiry state
    API-->>Web: Staff, roles, permissions, expiry state

    Owner->>Web: Invite staff member with role/permissions
    Web->>API: POST /admin/staff/invite
    API->>Guard: Validate staff-write permission and entitlement
    Guard->>Staff: Normalize and enforce seat/access policy
    Staff->>DB: Create expiring invitation and audit event
    Staff->>Mail: Queue invitation message
    Mail-->>Staff: Delivery accepted/status
    Staff-->>API: Delivery accepted/status
    API-->>Web: Delivery accepted/status

    opt Invitee accepts
        Invitee->>API: POST /staff-access/accept-invite with token/password
        API->>Staff: Validate one-time token and expiry
        Staff->>DB: Create/activate tenant user and revoke token
        Staff->>Audit: Record accepted invitation
    end

    Owner->>Web: Update access, issue reset, or deactivate
    Web->>API: Protected staff mutation
    API->>Guard: Recheck actor permission and target constraints
    Guard->>Staff: Apply role/permission/status change
    Staff->>DB: Persist mutation and revoke affected sessions
    Staff->>Audit: Record actor, target, and reason
    API-->>Web: Sanitized access result
